 `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves an [RFC 6901 JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901)
 against a JSON document. It returns the referenced value, including the complete document for the empty
 pointer, and throws when the pointer is malformed or has no matching value.
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+array using the standard `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. It returns
+a new JSON value without mutating the document or patch, and throws when an operation or patch is invalid.
